  "_review": "Design Review (GDD 7): every risk is a failure mode with a chance p; the launch succeeds with the product of (1 - p). 'Fix' multiplies a rocket risk by fix_factor for fix_weeks weeks and fix_cost_frac x the unit cost (at least fix_cost_min); the chosen fixes run in parallel (the delay is the longest one). The payload risk is ProjectDesk's p_payload (projects.json launch); its fix (an extra readiness review) cuts the residual defects to payload_fix_defects and adds payload_fix_rel to the reliability fraction. Risks below 'low' are green, at 'high' and above red. Scrub cancels the launch: the team is freed and the reputation drops by scrub_reputation.",
